{
  "_comment": [
    "Random Outfit Generator (generator/). generator/index.html reads this file; outfit_generator.py applies the same rules in Python and sync_catalog.py (report item 11) checks it.",
    "themes[].campaigns + unthemed must list every campaign in products.json exactly once (a missing or unknown campaign fails CI). Unthemed campaigns only appear under Theme = Any.",
    "slots: which categories.json tabs/subs ('tab' or 'tab/sub') can fill each slot. fan_gear subs are added only for a theme with \"fan_gear\": true, and come from every campaign. Fan Gear never appears otherwise.",
    "Each outfit is top + bottom + shoes + one extra slot, picked at random from extra_slots (falling back to the other when the first has nothing valid).",
    "borrow: a theme also draws those slots from another theme's campaigns.",
    "exclude: product ids never used (suit sets clash with the Bottom slot; golf items aren't wearable). categories.json 'hidden' products are always left out too.",
    "rules: 'never' bans a category outright; 'if' + 'not_with' bans two categories in the same outfit; 'if' + 'only_with' allows the 'if' category only alongside one of the listed ones.",
    "budgets: the tiers offered (CAD, total of the four items). A budget only uses priced items (no Amazon) and the total must stay under it."
  ],
